[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 600.37, "timestamp": "00:10:00", "text": "玩玩看，价格很便宜。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 603.19, "timestamp": "00:10:03", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 604.67, "timestamp": "00:10:04", "text": "乔，做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 608.389, "timestamp": "00:10:08", "text": "你现在住在哪里？是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 611.509, "timestamp": "00:10:11", "text": "在直播中问这个问题可以吗？我住在我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 614.55, "timestamp": "00:10:14", "text": "家。不用担心。我搬了出去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 618.67, "timestamp": "00:10:18", "text": "呃，我刚才说的那个地方是暂时的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 622.069, "timestamp": "00:10:22", "text": "是的。是的。这将是我的直播间。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 627.03, "timestamp": "00:10:27", "text": "这就是为什么我买了张大桌子之类的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 630.87, "timestamp": "00:10:30", "text": "但遗憾的是，没有专门的办公室。是的，我可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 634.47, "timestamp": "00:10:34", "text": "就这么说。你需要给我一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 637.43, "timestamp": "00:10:37", "text": "房间参观直播之外，伙计。我仍然"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 640.23, "timestamp": "00:10:40", "text": "记得Doc有一次不小心给我打了个电话吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 643.269, "timestamp": "00:10:43", "text": "他甚至都没等我同意就带我参观了房间。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 647.43, "timestamp": "00:10:47", "text": "主动要求的。哦，是啊，很久以前了，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 649.59, "timestamp": "00:10:49", "text": "我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 653.67, "timestamp": "00:10:53", "text": "他刚睡醒。"}]